    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tier 2 Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved governance</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia supported seven key in-line and advisory positions in the GoN Ministry of Finance and Nauru Utilities Corporation responsible for supporting management of Nauru&#x2019;s national budget, tax and revenue collection and reforms, debt management, public accounts, national development planning and aid coordination and infrastructure planning. Key results: Fiscal and budgetary plans and reports were completed on time, tax system compliance was strengthened, PFM systems including fiscal and debt management arrangements were strengthened in line with IMF recommendations, State Owned Enterprise improved compliance and accountability,  successful reconciliations of the Government of Nauru bank accounts with Financial Management Information System (FMIS) records.</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-07-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-06-30"></period-end>
    </period>
   </indicator>
